<SubpageLayout title="Naoero ekonomi · Economy" description="The economy after phosphate, with public services, fisheries and future opportunities." sectionEmoji="📈" sectionLabel="Ekonomi" includeTopBar={true} includeFooter={true} locale="na">
  <p>Nauru's economy has been shaped by phosphate extraction, the loss of that resource and the ongoing effort to build a more resilient base through services, fisheries and public investment.</p>
<h2>Big picture</h2>
<p>Today, the country depends on a mix of public-sector activity, international partnerships and narrow but important revenue streams. This means budgets and services matter directly to everyday life.</p>
